  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div><ix:nonNumeric id="F_7e338a75-d2cc-4a52-a8a0-dfaf4af15f2d" contextRef="C_d3b7f9e0-7fa3-4947-bd31-b6fc6167985a" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_7e338a75-d2cc-4a52-a8a0-dfaf4af15f2d_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:18pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">10. Equity</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_ce19fc05-f01a-41e7-a0cd-fa21cea0f471" contextRef="C_d3b7f9e0-7fa3-4947-bd31-b6fc6167985a" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfStockholdersEquityTableTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:12pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The following table summarizes the changes in our stockholders&#8217; equity for the </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">three months ended March 31, 2025 and 2024 and has been retrospectively adjusted to reflect the Reverse Stock Split and Reverse Unit Split, see Note 1 Organization and Basis of Presentation (amounts in thousands, except share amounts):</span></p>
