       </table><p style="margin-left:3.333%;text-indent:-3.448%;padding-left:3.333%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:12pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(1) As of both December 31, 2024 and 2023, the Company reclassified $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_94e50bce-4bed-4ba4-a493-e8a90acca838" contextRef="C_18b3f857-8681-40d1-a18c-9e4a5f71cb58" name="dea:ReclassificationOfReverseStockSplit" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_03abb3bd-5949-4daf-9d99-7fd8e49d4387" contextRef="C_8d9e9a8d-f0d8-4f6f-81c6-ae4562960551" name="dea:ReclassificationOfReverseStockSplit" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.6</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million from Common Stock to Additional Paid-in-Capital due to the reduction in shares outstanding in connection with the Reverse Stock Split effective April 28, 2025.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_c499a5c9-799d-41a7-a32f-49b0c8701773" contextRef="C_d3b7f9e0-7fa3-4947-bd31-b6fc6167985a" name="us-gaap:DividendsDeclaredTableTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:12pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">A summary of dividends declared by our Board of Directors per share of common stock and per common unit (as adjusted to reflect the Reverse Stock Split and Reve